# Atrium Internal Portal — Implementation Plan (v2)

## Background

Auth is complete (login, signup, Google OAuth, complete-registration, pending/rejected flows). The root `/` page is a placeholder. We need to build a **permission-based internal portal** where each role sees different dashboard modules based on their position's permissions.

---

## Role → Dashboard Module Matrix

Each position only sees the modules their permissions grant. The sidebar dynamically hides/shows items.

| Module | Permission Required | MDO | Chair | Vice Chair | Gen Sec | Tech Head | Creative Head | Treasurer | Web Master | Tech Associate | Marketing Associate | Member |
|:-------|:-------------------|:---:|:-----:|:----------:|:-------:|:---------:|:-------------:|:---------:|:----------:|:--------------:|:-------------------:|:------:|
| **Dashboard Home** | *(always)* | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **My Events** | *(always)* | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Create Event** | `create_events` | | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | | | ✅ | | |
| **Approve Registrations** | `approve_registrations` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | | | | |
| **Pre-Approved Members** | `approve_registrations` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | | | | |
| **Approve Events** | `approve_events` | | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | | | | |
| **Manage Events** | `manage_events` | | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | | | | |
| **Members Directory** | `view_members` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | |
| **Manage Members** | `manage_members` | | ✅ | ✅ | | | | | | | | |
