> [!NOTE]
> New positions (Treasurer, Web Master, Technical Associate, Marketing Associate) start with **no special permissions** — they see Dashboard Home + My Events. An admin can grant them additional permissions later via Manage Members. This is by design: the permission system is flexible and doesn't require code changes.

