## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Dashboard Shell & Permission Engine

The shell provides sidebar, top bar, and shared layout. The permission engine decides what each user sees.

#### [NEW] `src/lib/permissions.ts`
Core permission utility. Server-side functions:
- `getUserPermissions(profileId, branchId?)` — returns Set of permission names by combining position-based + direct grants + superadmin bypass
- `hasPermission(profileId, permission, branchId?)` — boolean check
- `getUserProfile(profileId)` — full profile with active memberships and positions
- Uses the exact SQL pattern from SCHEMA.md §9

#### [NEW] `src/lib/queries.ts`
Shared Supabase query helpers:
- `getDashboardStats(branchId?)` — event counts by status, pending registrations, active members
- `getRecentActivity(limit)` — from `event_audit_log`
- `getPendingRegistrations()` — profiles with `status = 'pending'`
- `getPreApprovedMembers()` — from `pre_approved_members` table
- `getMembers(branchId?, search?)` — approved members with positions

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx`
Route group layout wrapping all portal pages. Contains:
- Fetches user profile + permissions server-side
- Passes permissions to the sidebar via props
- Wraps children in sidebar + top bar shell

#### [NEW] `src/components/portal/sidebar.tsx`
Client component with:
- Atrium branding (Landmark icon + "Atrium")
- Nav links dynamically shown/hidden based on user permissions
- Sections: **Overview** (Dashboard), **Events** (My Events, Create Event, Approve Events), **People** (Approvals, Pre-Approved, Members), **System** (Audit Log, Analytics)
- Active state via `usePathname()`
- Collapse toggle (desktop) / sheet overlay (mobile)
- User card at bottom: avatar, name, position badge, branch

#### [NEW] `src/components/portal/top-bar.tsx`
- Mobile hamburger trigger
- Page title / breadcrumb
- Theme toggle (dark/light via `next-themes`)
- User dropdown (profile, sign out)

