### Phase 3 — Approval & Pre-Approval Management (MDO / Chair / Vice Chair)

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/approvals/page.tsx`
**Requires `approve_registrations`**. Two tabs:
1. **Pending Queue** — cards for each pending member: name, email, IEEE ID, branch they selected, role they selected, registration date. Approve ✅ / Reject ❌ buttons. Reject opens reason textarea.
2. **History** — recently approved/rejected registrations with who approved and when.

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/approvals/actions.ts`
- `approveRegistration(profileId)` — sets `status='approved'`, `approved_by`, `approved_at`
- `rejectRegistration(profileId, reason)` — sets `status='rejected'`, `rejected_reason`
- Permission check: caller must have `approve_registrations`

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/pre-approved/page.tsx`
**Requires `approve_registrations`**. Manage the pre-approved members list:
- Table of all pre-approved IEEE IDs with name, email
- Add new pre-approved member form (IEEE ID + name + optional email)
- Delete pre-approved entry
- Shows which pre-approved IDs have already been claimed by registered users

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/pre-approved/actions.ts`
- `addPreApprovedMember(ieeeMembershipId, name, email?)`
- `removePreApprovedMember(id)`

