### Phase 4 — Members Directory & Management

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/members/page.tsx`
**Requires `view_members`**. Paginated table:
- Columns: Name, Email, Branch, Position, IEEE ID, Phone, Joined Date, Status
- Search by name/email
- Filter by branch
- Click row to expand member detail (membership history, permissions)

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/members/actions.ts`
**Requires `manage_members`**:
- `assignPosition(profileId, branchId, positionId)` — end old membership, create new
- `grantPermission(profileId, branchId, permissionId)` — direct permission grant
- `revokePermission(memberPermissionId)` — set `revoked_at`

---

### Phase 5 — Events (CRUD + Approval Flow)

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/events/page.tsx`
Tabs based on permissions:
- **My Events** *(all users)* — events created by current user
- **All Events** *(requires `manage_events`)* — every event in the branch
- **Pending Approval** *(requires `approve_events`)* — events awaiting review

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/events/create/page.tsx`
**Requires `create_events`**. Form: name, description, date, location, capacity, event type (from `event_types`), branch, banner upload. Creates with `status = 'draft'`.

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/events/[id]/page.tsx`
Event detail: full info, status badge, approval timeline, action buttons:
- Creator: Edit (if draft), Submit for Approval, Delete
- Approver: Approve / Reject with comment
- Manager: Publish

#### [NEW] `src/app/(portal)/events/actions.ts`
- `createEvent(formData)`, `updateEvent(id, formData)`, `deleteEvent(id)`
- `submitForApproval(id)` — changes status to `pending_approval`
- `approveEvent(id, comment)`, `rejectEvent(id, comment)` — creates `event_approvals` row
- `publishEvent(id)` — sets `status='published'`, `published_at`

